IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EMPLOYEE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-EMP-ID       PIC 9(5) VALUE 10001.
01 WS-EMP-NAME     PIC X(20) VALUE "SANJAY".
01 WS-BASIC        PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 25000.00.
01 WS-HRA          PIC 9(6)V99.
01 WS-DA           PIC 9(6)V99.
01 WS-GROSS        PIC 9(7)V99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    COMPUTE WS-HRA = WS-BASIC * 0.20
    COMPUTE WS-DA = WS-BASIC * 0.10

    COMPUTE WS-GROSS =
        WS-BASIC + WS-HRA + WS-DA

    DISPLAY "EMPLOYEE ID: " WS-EMP-ID
    DISPLAY "EMPLOYEE NAME: " WS-EMP-NAME
    DISPLAY "BASIC SALARY: " WS-BASIC
    DISPLAY "HRA: " WS-HRA
    DISPLAY "DA: " WS-DA
    DISPLAY "GROSS SALARY: " WS-GROSS

    STOP RUN.